  "label": "Anti-White Stereotype: Mass Shootings",
  "description": "The text 'mass shootings' is used as a stereotype to imply that white people are disproportionately responsible for mass shootings. This is a false and dangerous stereotype that ignores the complex social, economic, and psychological factors behind gun violence and misattributes blame to race. It is a form of racialized violence attribution.",
